
# macOS
.DS_Store

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.tfplan
**/*.tfplan.*

# Per-developer override files (should never be committed)
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Note: we DO commit .terraform.lock.hcl per HashiCorp's guidance, so it isn't
# excluded here. We also commit terraform.tfvars (single source of truth in Git).

# mise (https://mise.jdx.dev) per-developer overrides
mise.local.toml
.mise.local.toml

# Build output (regenerated by build.sh / deploy workflow)
dist/

# Local-only AI tooling and instructions
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Cover letters: per-application, sensitive (recipient names, tailored claims).
# example.md is the only file kept in the repo as a template.
src/cover-letters/*
!src/cover-letters/example.md
